WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.004
This is how your social media automation
gets set up, once we start.

2
00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:15.092
Once we start, we begin with your brand:
what you sell, who you talk to, and what you
want to post. We adapt it to your brand.

3
00:00:15.892 --> 00:00:28.300
You connect your accounts through a secure
OAuth connection. You sign in on the
platform's own page and approve access. We
never see your password. Access is granted
only for the accounts you choose.

4
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:36.324
If an account is new, we handle the initial
warm-up period. We build up activity
gradually before automation starts.

5
00:00:37.124 --> 00:00:49.940
Together we plan a posting calendar. For
each post you pick the day, the time, and
the platform: TikTok, Instagram or YouTube.
The calendar then drives everything that
follows.

6
00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:59.424
Each post is reviewed and approved by you
before it is published. Only approved posts
move on to publishing. Nothing is posted
that you have not seen.

7
00:01:00.224 --> 00:01:10.112
Approved posts go out on your calendar. We
keep a record of every post, so there is a
clear trail of what went out, and on which
platform.

8
00:01:10.912 --> 00:01:16.480
Done. Need help? Email founder at
ironvisiontools dot com.
